<title>USA: Ascend net income at $2.9 mln for July.</title>
<headline>Ascend net income at $2.9 mln for July.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascend Communications said Monday it had consolidated net income of about $2.9 million for the 31-day period ended July 31, 1997.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Ascend also reported consolidated sales of about $62.8 million.</p>
<p>No comparable figures were available for the Alameda, California-based company.</p>
</text>
